# The overload guard is not heard: it thins the drones by fading their extra oscillators out and back
# (a sudden change of a held drone's stack was a click). HUMORUM's latched drones, the guard forced on
# and off; the recording must have no clicks (tests: guard_smooth.wav, checked by the click count).
wait 300
preset 6
tap PLAY
wait 2000
tapkey b2
tapkey b3
wait 4000
wav guard_smooth.wav
load 95
wait 100
expect guard 1
load 40
wait 4000
expect guard 0
load 95
wait 3000
load 40
wait 4000
expect guard 0
wavstop
tap PLAY
